@CivicHeroApi = http://localhost:5180
@CorrelationId = phase1-manual-test

### API health
GET {{CivicHeroApi}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{CorrelationId}}

### Correlation header check
GET {{CivicHeroApi}}/api/v1/health/headers
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: {{CorrelationId}}

### ASP.NET Core liveness probe
GET {{CivicHeroApi}}/health/live
Accept: application/json
